  "label": "User projected onto the hateful text overlay targeting Nelly",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'nagger!' which is directly targeted at Nelly, the visual material. The text 'i see you' at the top projects the user's awareness onto Nelly, while 'nagger!' at the bottom projects the user's hateful intent and identity as the aggressor onto the targeted visual entity. The meme constructs a confrontational scene where the user is implicitly 'you' in the 'i see you' statement and the aggressor delivering the slur, projecting the user's hostile identity onto the scene and the subject.",
